<title>FRANCE: France orders 15 GIAT Leclerc recovery vehicles.</title>
<headline>France orders 15 GIAT Leclerc recovery vehicles.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's defence ministry has asked state-owned Giat Industries to develop a recovery vehicle for the Leclerc battle tank and deliver a batch of 15 units, the CDFT labour union at GIAT said.</p>
<p>The labour union statement reproduced a letter from Defence Minister Charles Millon in which he said GIAT had won a tender over Germany's Rheinmetall Berlin AG.</p>
</text>
